<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/22/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act may be cited as the Lembaga Kemajuan Ikan Malaysia (Amendment) Act 2011."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/22/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/22/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/22/eng@/~cl_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/22/eng@> .
